<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-BOARDMAN WINS TIME TRIAL STAGE IN CATALONIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-BOARDMAN WINS TIME TRIAL STAGE IN CATALONIA.</headline>
<dateline>VIC, Spain 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chris Boardman of Britain won the fifth stage of the Tour of Catalonia on Monday, a time-trial over 22 km.</p>
</text>
